# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Render Static Site — HTTP cache headers
#
# index.html and the SPA fallback MUST NEVER be cached, otherwise mobile
# browsers (Android Chrome, iOS Safari) will keep serving an old shell that
# references obsolete /assets/index-XXXX.js bundles, and any new code we
# ship (timeouts, retries, wake-up, bug fixes) won't reach the user.
#
# Hashed assets under /assets/ are content-addressed by Vite, so they ARE
# safe to cache aggressively (immutable, 1-year).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/photos/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/destinations/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/logo.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
